#!/usr/bin/env python3
“””
gallery_to_md.py — LLM Architecture Gallery → Structured Markdown/JSON

Fetches Sebastian Raschka’s LLM Architecture Gallery and converts it into
a clean, machine-readable “pool of ideas” for autoresearch agents.

Inspired by Andrej Karpathy’s request (March 15, 2026):
“Nice! My autoresearch would love some markdown version of this - pool of ideas.”

Usage:
python gallery_to_md.py –output llm_ideas_pool.md
python gallery_to_md.py –output pool.md –json pool.json –force-refresh
python gallery_to_md.py –diff  # compare against last cached version

